   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Ну что, ты доволен?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Well, are you pleased?' ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "доволен?",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", meaning pleased, is shaped for a man, while a woman would use a different ending. ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Ну что,",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " translates to 'well then'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Я очень рад, шеф, только выпью кофе.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I am very glad, Chef, just let me drink coffee.' ",
